r class=3D"Transcript-module-scss-module__no3g7q__header"><h3 class=3D"copy=
-01 Transcript-module-scss-module__no3g7q__heading">Tekst</h3><button type=
=3D"button" aria-label=3D"Transcript sluiten" class=3D"Transcript-module-sc=
ss-module__no3g7q__close"><span class=3D"Icon-module-scss-module__JR2hNG__i=
con false"><svg xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xml:space=3D"preserve"=
